<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f1e8">
    <title>Мои ссылки</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            --ink: #20241f;
            --muted: #696d63;
            --paper: #f5f1e8;
            --lime: #c8f169;
            --line: #dedbcf;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 32px 20px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: var(--ink);
            background-color: var(--paper);
            background-image: radial-gradient(#d8d3c5 0.8px, transparent 0.8px);
            background-size: 18px 18px;
            font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
        }

        main {
            width: min(100%, 480px);
            padding: 34px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: rgba(255, 254, 249, 0.94);
            box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #dedbcf;
            animation: arrive 500ms ease-out both;
        }

        .topline {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .status {
            width: 9px;
            height: 9px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #72bc69;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #e3f3d9;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 22px 0 8px;
            font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(38px, 10vw, 54px);
            line-height: 0.98;
        }

        h1 span {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0 7px 4px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            background: var(--lime);
            transform: rotate(-2deg);
        }

        .bio {
            max-width: 340px;
            margin: 18px 0 28px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .links {
            display: grid;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .link {
            min-height: 58px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: #fffef9;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 160ms ease, background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
        }

        .link:hover, .link:focus-visible {
            border-color: var(--ink);
            background: var(--lime);
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .link:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #568b36; outline-offset: 3px; }

        .link-name { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }

        .icon {
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #f0eee5;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .arrow { font-size: 18px; }

        footer {
            margin-top: 24px;
            color: #8a8b80;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        @keyframes arrive {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @media (max-width: 420px) {
            body { padding: 18px 14px; }
            main { padding: 26px 20px; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <div class="topline"><span class="status" aria-hidden="true"></span> на связи с вами Ashia</div>
        <h1>Привет, я<br><span>Ash1aaa</span></h1>
        <p>Программист и веб-разработчик</p>

        <nav class="links" aria-label="Мои контакты">
            <a class="link" href="https://discord.com/users/sansx._.
" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <span class="link-name"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">D</span>Discord</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
            <a class="link" href="https://t.me/
" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <span class="link-name"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>Telegram</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
            <a class="link" href="https://github.com/Ash1aaa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <span class="link-name"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span>GitHub</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
            <a class="link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199257312271/">
                <span class="link-name"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">@</span>Steam</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
        </nav>

        <footer>Наглядний пример таких сайтов</footer>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
